# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Public site URL
# Used for canonical URLs, sitemap.xml, robots.txt, Open Graph and JSON-LD.
# Do not include a trailing slash.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://infimumconsulting.com.au

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contact form email delivery (Microsoft Graph API)
#
# The form returns a clear "not configured" error (HTTP 503) until all values
# below are set. It never simulates a successful submission.
#
# Microsoft Entra ID (Azure AD) app registration — server-side only.
# 1. Create an app registration in the company's Microsoft Entra tenant.
# 2. Add the Microsoft Graph application permission Mail.Send.
# 3. Grant administrator consent for the permission.
# 4. Create a client secret (or certificate) and record its expiry date.
# 5. Set MICROSOFT_SENDER_EMAIL to the authorised sending mailbox.
# 6. Set CONTACT_TO_EMAIL to the inbox that should receive enquiries.
# 7. (Recommended) Restrict the app to the sending mailbox via Exchange
#    Online Application RBAC / ApplicationAccessPolicy.
#
# Treat all Microsoft credentials as secrets. Never commit real values.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
MICROSOFT_TENANT_ID=
MICROSOFT_CLIENT_ID=
MICROSOFT_CLIENT_SECRET=

MICROSOFT_SENDER_EMAIL=
CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=
